PK Tracker is a quantified-self visualization tool. It is not a medical device,
does not provide medical advice, and must not be used to make decisions about
prescription medication, alcohol consumption, driving, operating machinery, or
any other safety-critical activity.

All pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic outputs are estimates derived from
population-average models. Individual metabolism and response vary widely.
